  "query_preview": "..\n\nWEATHER PATTERN OVERVIEW:\nThere is an interplay between the upper ridge and shortwave trough\npassages today and tomorrow. A shortwave trough this evening will\nbring a slight chance of a thunderstorm in Petroleum county from\n23Z to 03Z Thursday. Then another wave tomorrow after 23Z that is\nexpected to penetrate into central parts of the area. Then\nlingering showers and weak storms the rest of the night. Another\nshortwave trough with a bit more punch is expected on Friday. Near\nsevere winds are expected with each of these waves. A more\nsignificant trough is expected to make its way in this weekend.\n\nFORECAST CONFIDENCE & DEVIATIONS:\nMade deviations to the PoPs by including HREF data.\n\nModerate confidence in the entire forecast.",
